This crate is original work: an independent implementation of the YTsaurus RPC
proxy protocol, written against the official documentation and the upstream C++
and Go clients, and checked against byte vectors produced by them. No upstream
source is redistributed here.

It depends on ytsaurus-proto, whose contents are generated from YTsaurus's own
.proto files; see that crate's NOTICE.
